Revision history for Poker-Eval

0.11    2026-08-20
        - Restore $VERSION on all packages so PAUSE can reindex after 0.10
        - (0.10 left previously indexed modules stuck at 0.09)

0.10    2026-08-20
        - Add Poker::Game named-variant API:
            Community: Holdem, HoldemJokersWild, Pineapple, CrazyPineapple,
                       Omaha, OmahaHiLo, Omaha5, Omaha5HiLo,
                       Courcheval, CourchevalHiLo
            Draw:      FiveCardDraw, Deuces/Jokers wild, 2-7 and A-5 draw
            Stud:      SevenCardStud, SevenCardStudHiLo, Razz
            Badugi:    Badugi, Badacey, Badeucy
        - Only Poker::Eval defines $VERSION (cleaner CPAN index)
        - Joker support via Poker::Deck/Dealer joker_count
        - Fix equity: ties split 1/N; sims use residual (undealt) deck
        - Reference equity tests vs known Hold'em matchups
        - Document equity, score, and core methods in README / Game POD

0.09    2016
        - Prior CPAN release

0.01    January 3, 2016
        - Initial release
